  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Expertise (1) in Metaphysics</p><p>You spend some time sizing an enemy up, watching how they move, and learning their attack patterns.</p><p>As an <strong>Action</strong>, you can study an enemy you can see within <strong>30 spaces</strong>.</p><p>If you do so, your <strong>Defense</strong> increases by <strong>+1</strong> against your target until the end of combat.</p><p>You can only study one creature at a time. If you want to change your studied target, you may do so with another <strong>Action</strong>.</p>",
